"fool_financial" = "The card advises you to make a spontaneous decision. And most importantly, that such a decision will bring you the desired result. In any case, something new and very exciting awaits you here. You get a chance to start writing your story from scratch.";
"magicianCard_financial" = "The card says that you are a knowledgeable person, with a sharp mind and are able to rise above this world. The chosen path will be completely in your hands and your power. Feel free to go ahead and build your being, you can do it.";
"highpriestessCard_financial" = "When making a decision, you need to listen to your own intuition. You will find the answers you need within yourself. Pointing to a specific specific chosen path, the card indicates the presence of hidden moments and secrets in it.";
"empressCard_financial" = "You need to realize those desires on the basis of which you create your destiny. You are completely self-sufficient and the choice must be made carefully based on your own interests and preferences. Choose yourself in any situation. Speaking about a certain path and choice, the empress says that in the chosen path you will find a huge development, growth, flourishing and integrity of your personality.";
"emperorCard_financial" = "You need to make a choice based on your moral principles and foundations. Try to weigh what will be the most correct for you. Remember also that you will need to be responsible for this choice, so weigh everything as much as possible. Considering a certain path and the chosen road, the card says that on the chosen path you will gain power and status thanks to your determination, integrity and firmness.";
"hierophantCard_financial" = "The card can point you to a knowledgeable person who will give you good advice or guide you. It could be about you or someone close to you. If you are not the mentor, then the card shows the need to follow the traditional path, obedience, fulfillment of spiritual and social norms and rules. Such an attitude will lead you to success, gaining awareness and expanding the usual scope of vision. Speaking about a certain chosen path, she speaks of the correctness of the choice, that it is along this path that you will increase your spiritual level.";
"lovesCard_financial" = "When making an important decision, listen to the voice of your heart - it will tell you what to do. The responsibility for the choice rests solely with you. Be prepared for this if the consequences are unpleasant. Speaking of a specific direction, the chosen path will give you a sense of flight, passion and inspiration. Be careful with this, because the outcome can be quite unpredictable.";
"chariotCard_financial" = "It has been given to you to curb the opposing forces, and you must use this skill, subordinating them to reason and labor. Pointing to a certain path, the card says that thanks to the strength of your spirit, you will move forward without turning off. The goal you set will make you a leader and a self-confident person.";
"strengthCard_financial" = "Whatever choice you make, you will be fine. Any immovable rock will succumb to you if you show wisdom and generosity. Everything is at your fingertips. Speaking about the specifically chosen road, the map indicates that when walking along it, you will have enough courage, fortitude and determination to walk this path with dignity and ease.";
"hermitCard_financial" = "It's not the best time for you to dwell on anything specific right now. You need to look inside yourself, make a journey to the depths of your subconscious, understand where the truth is and what your destiny is. Don't rush to choose. You are on a journey of self-discovery. The answers are only within you. Speaking about a certain chosen road, the card says that spiritual searches will still have to be continued, gaining a deep understanding of what you want and why your soul came into this world. And you will have to walk this road alone.";
"wheelOfFortune_financial" = "The Wheel of Fortune says that you do not need to choose a specific path for your further movement now. The current stage of life is fateful and higher powers will lead you to the path and decision you need. Your life will change dramatically in the future, and when it comes time to make a choice - in any case, choose a new life stage and your development. The whole situation, in principle, serves to ensure that the higher forces help you to go exactly on your right path, which is the best for you.";
"justiceCard_financial" = "You must carefully consider everything before making any decision. If your case has reached court cases, they will be considered impartially. Choosing a certain path, the card says that your path will be fair for you and you can restore this very justice in any issues that concern you.";
"hangedCard_financial" = "You are not able to make a choice clearly and consciously enough for yourself in today's period of time. You need to overcome the victim complex and take responsibility for your life and your condition. If we talk about the specific path you have chosen, it will lead you to the fact that you will sacrifice yourself for this path or for the people who will accompany you on it.";
"deathCard_financial" = "Before choosing a path forward, let the change fully transform your personality. Now is a serious period for you, when there is still no definite further purpose of your personality. By pointing to a particular decision you have chosen, the card says that this path will completely transform and upend your personality and your usual way of life. You will move to a new stage of your development.";
"moderationCard_financial" = "You are perfectly capable of making a decision now. Your life has a fairly stable and balanced track, just like your worldview. Make a decision measuredly, not succumbing to sharp impulses. Pointing to the choice of a certain solution, the card says that this path will lead you to harmony and balance. By following this path, you will be able to gain stability in the long term.";
"devilCard_financial" = "You may be drawn to a decision that in the moment will give pleasure and celebration, but in the long run will bring total destruction to your life. be careful with the choice and do not rush to succumb to temptation. Choosing a certain solution can eventually lead to dependencies and you will let chaos energies into your space.";
"towerCard_financial" = "The card speaks of the destruction you are currently experiencing. And you don’t need to make a specific choice in the near future and it won’t quite work out. For the time being, you can take only an approximate and temporary direction. Whether you like it or not, your life will change significantly, and it is best to accept the changes that have come. You may be overcome by panic, tantrums, accusations of fate and higher powers, but after a while your opinion may change. You no longer need what is leaving you now, the time has come for deliverance. If we talk about a certain chosen further path, it can destroy today's habitual foundations, or any of the aspects of your life.";
"starCard_financial" = "You may be tormented by doubts and not focused on planning and a clear structural approach, but you may be in a dreamy state. In principle, this is good for you, try to hear your most cherished desires and dreams, they will help to form further plans and tasks in the future. When choosing a specific solution, new prospects await you along the chosen path, the fulfillment of your desires, and perhaps even popularity. The light of the guiding star will illuminate your path.";
"moonCard_financial" = "You cannot make a clear decision for yourself on this card now. Too many hidden circumstances and facts. The situation is not clear and the prospects are rather vague. You can be deceived, led figuratively through dark alleys, so it is better to let the truth gradually come out. Speaking about the specific road chosen, this path can be dangerous for you and the map warns that it would not be worth going there. Or simply the circumstances of this path do not want to be revealed to you in this period of time.";
"sunCard_financial" = "Today, all paths are open to you and illuminated. You can choose absolutely any road that brings you pleasure. In any choice, happiness, success, cheerfulness and new perspectives await you. Pointing to a certain path, the card says that it will be really successful for you, open and filled with a lot of new opportunities.";
"doomsdayCard_financial" = "If you are inclined towards a certain decision, then you definitely make the right decision. The main thing is to take it not entirely with your head, but to feel it. Higher powers led you to this and this decision is fateful for you. Pointing to a certain road, the card says that healing and renewal awaits you on this path, and this is your fateful road that you need to follow.";
"worldCard_financial" = "The world is pushing you to move forward and improve your life. The chosen decision and path will fill you with happiness and allow you to enjoy communication with friends, colleagues or your loved one. You perfectly cope with your duties, and perhaps even decide to go on a trip or travel.";

//Figure

"pageOfPentacles_financial" = "This is a card of caution, choice and determination to enter a new phase of life. Therefore, if you are tormented by a choice in any situation, approach it carefully enough, counting all the minuses and pluses. This card may warn you that the choice it came up with is your chance, but you have a lot to learn and put in the effort.";
"pageOfSwords_financial" = "You need to think through everything carefully and calculate all the steps and nuances of the decision being made before taking action. The situation can be nervous, so it is necessary to weigh everything very well, and also find a peaceful solution.";
"pageOfWands_financial" = "Having received a sign or a chance, do not miss it, even if it is associated with risk. The choice on which this card lay down will bring you pleasant emotions and enthusiasm. If you save a fire that flares up, you can turn it into something eternal.";
"pageOfCups_financial" = "Trust your feelings and your own intuition - only it will help you cope with troubles and help you make the best and most adequate decision. The card may indicate that the choice on which the page of cups fell promises a chance that will inspire you and give birth to new ideas.";
"knightOfPentacles_financial" = "There is no reason to worry, you will definitely achieve your desired goal, but only if you calmly and systematically carry out your actions. When a card falls on a certain choice, it indicates that the situation will develop rather slowly and you will have to make a lot of efforts.";
"knightOfSwords_financial" = "You should put your thoughts in order, do not take hasty actions and do not make final decisions. And even when the decision has already been made by you, it is important for you not to be distracted and bring all your affairs to the end. Falling on a specific choice, this card implies that with this decision you will have to fight, and perhaps not even by your own decision.";
"knightOfWands_financial" = "You can hardly do without risk. And you should not count on a cloudless, even, stable development of the situation either. But this should not frighten or upset you, because it is precisely the difficulties that temper the character and allow you to prove yourself in the best possible way in a responsible matter. But too much perseverance should not be shown either.";
"knightOfCups_financial" = "The card advises you to build realistic goals and plans that you can achieve in a short time. Do not soar in the clouds, do not waste your time senselessly, spend it with benefit. You should not drive yourself into the framework, no one needs it. If your soul asks for a holiday, arrange a holiday for yourself, fulfill your old dream. If you can’t make a choice, try to feel what your soul is more for.";
"kingOfPentacles_financial" = "Life is not a vicious circle of problems, don't ask too many questions out of the blue. Allow yourself to rest from time to time so as not to harm your own health. Devote more time to family and hobbies. Even passive pastime during the weekend is also a vacation, do not limit yourself to this. If the card goes on a specific specific chosen path, then it says that this path will give you a feeling of love, goodness and fullness, everything will work out.";
"kingOfSwords_financial" = "The King of Swords recommends that you dissociate yourself and look at the situation from the outside. You need to make a decision based on your sober mind and cold mind. Pointing to a specific choice, the card says that in order to achieve your goals, you will have to fight.";
"kingOfWands_financial" = "Feel free to implement your plans for the future - the card promises joy and a favorable set of circumstances, provided that you are not afraid to take risks and show the strongest traits of your character. Be creative or follow clear rules and you will succeed and win over important people on whom your future may depend. Choosing a specific option, the card says that success awaits you on the chosen path, gaining leadership positions and status.";
"kingOfCups_financial" = "The King of Cups can say that a cultured and educated person will listen to you and give good advice. Or you will need the ability to listen to one of your friends or relatives. Now you are in a situation where you are expected to show concern or sympathy. You can find understanding in a mature, emotionally stable man. This may be your father or the man who replaces him plays a significant role in your life. Speaking of a particular specific chosen path, the card says that this path will bring you spiritual fulfillment.";
"queenOfPentacles_financial" = "The Queen of Pentacles advises you to proceed slowly, calmly and without fuss. Don't let anyone influence your thoughts and actions. Focus on the issue at hand. By pointing to a certain choice, the card tells you that it will lead you to stability and order.";
"queenOfSwords_financial" = "The Queen of Swords tells you that your own intuition will be the best adviser and assistant. The main thing is that you can show all your best qualities. When choosing a certain path, she speaks of a rather acute set of circumstances.";
"queenOfWands_financial" = "An attractive, sensible woman can give you good advice. The energy, independence of thoughts, kindness and generosity of the Queen of Wands promise the successful completion of any work begun. This is a woman who understands business and is determined to make a career, she can also be the soul of the company. She is able to create around herself an atmosphere of confidence that attracts others to her. Pointing to a specific choice, the card says that success and inspiration await in the chosen path.";
"queenOfCups_financial" = "Excessive emotionality in different situations can be your minus or plus. Sensitivity is useful in relationships with loved ones, when you want to spend more time with them, give them care and warmth. However, such a trait can be actively discussed behind the back. A well-developed intuition will tell you how to act in a given situation. It will help to determine with the least probability of error which person is in front of you, what he is going to do, whether he has bad intentions and insidious plans.";

//Numeral

"aceOfPentacles_financial" = "Do not miss your chance, even if it seems too risky and unrealistic to you - you will be able to cope with all the difficulties and make your life more interesting and brighter. Wait for the good news, the improvement of things - today you can both start new things and finish them, make them brighter and more interesting, everything will promise success.";
"aceOfSwords_financial" = "Do not take dangerous and risky actions, as this can lead to unpredictable consequences, especially at night. Such a card promises major trouble, danger, or a sudden change in circumstances for the worse, but whatever you encounter, do not give up and try to act quickly.";
"aceOfWands_financial" = "Do not be lazy and take the initiative, do not be afraid to be active, even if you do not believe in yourself and doubt yourself. Circumstances do not require delay, so you will have to show character and act actively, and, of course, you will not miss an important offer that will help you achieve success and the desired result.";
"aceOfCups_financial" = "Try to hear yourself, act from spiritual impulses. Here you won’t be able to get away from yourself, hide feelings. Such an attempt will lead to disappointment, inner anguish and depression. The problem can be solved only by sincere conversation, openness of intentions and recognition of feelings. The Ace of Cups warns you about your excessive sensitivity, trust in treacherous people. If you go about your feelings, you can get a heart wound.";
"twoOfPentacles_financial" = "Do not trust people too much and count on successful cooperation, if you doubt yourself - this can only spoil everything. Check out new opportunities and take advantage of them, only in this case you will be able to achieve success and what you really need. Try everything new and interesting.";
"twoOfSwords_financial" = "Give yourself time to think and be alone with yourself - this is what will help you cope with difficulties and resolve all your doubts on your own. Do not try to intervene in other people's conflicts and follow the advice - now you just need to relax for a while and independently assess the situation.";
"twoOfWands_financial" = "Try to accept the business proposal and properly assess your resources. You may have to think for a while, so do not rush to make a quick decision without assessing your capabilities and prospects. The card warns you against mental overwork and overestimation of your own strengths and capabilities.";
"twoOfCups_financial" = "Do not refuse new meetings, acquaintances and communication with interesting people, even if this temporarily disrupts your plans. It is through acquaintances and meetings that you will be able to cope with all the difficulties or find an unexpected solution to the problem that worries you the most at the moment, and the meetings promise to be pleasant.";
"threeOfPentacles_financial" = "Be active and try to put all your affairs in order. Such a card portends joy, pleasant moments, happiness and the fact that you will be able to cope with all the troubles both on your own and together with other people. Try to be active and do not withdraw into yourself.";
"threeOfSwords_financial" = "You should not trust people too much and count on reciprocity in love - your feelings, desires and interests can be neglected at any moment, so try not to change anything in your life and do those things that do not require communication and contact with people, especially those who who do you trust.";
"threeOfWands_financial" = "Be active and try to achieve quick results in everything. Do not be afraid to overstrain - you will be able to overcome all difficulties and achieve the result you expected. Success will depend on how much you invest in new relationships and affairs, so do not allow yourself to be lazy, reason, show suspiciousness and impatience.";
"threeOfCups_financial" = "Do not refuse new meetings, acquaintances and communication with people who are interesting to you. Such a card promises you pleasant and very bright events, so try not to hide anything from your like-minded people, friends, acquaintances whom you believe and trust. The card indicates the success of any meetings and undertakings, holidays, but excessive arrogance should be avoided.";
"fourOfPentacles_financial" = "You need to beware of envious, greedy and greedy people who try to hold on to wealth and not share anything even with the closest people. This card portends you in big trouble if you cooperate with someone, so devote time to yourself or do a generous act.";
"fourOfSwords_financial" = "Give yourself time to think and be alone with yourself - this is what will help you cope with difficulties and solve the problem that haunts you. You should not tell anyone anything, except for those who can really help you - it is these people who can clarify the circumstances for you and help you find a way out.";
"fourOfWands_financial" = "Tune in to relax and try to spend as much time as possible with nice people. Do not be afraid to spend your savings or acquire valuable things - purchases made in the near future can turn out to be extremely successful and bring not only joy, but also benefit. Don't withdraw into yourself, communicate, but don't take on too much.";
"fourOfCups_financial" = "Do not refuse new meetings, acquaintances and communication with people who are interesting to you. Doubts and gloomy thoughts today will not bring anything good and can cause your troubles and problems in life. Therefore, try to communicate more with positive people and avoid gloomy thoughts and dramatization of the situation.";
"fiveOfPentacles_financial" = "Do not try to quickly change the situation and do not plan too much - it is unlikely that your hopes will come true in the near future. This card is considered the most negative in the suit of pentacles, it indicates inevitable losses, important, albeit bitter life lessons that should be taken into account for the future.";
"fiveOfSwords_financial" = "Get ready for troubles and unwanted discoveries - your enemy may appear in the near future or an unpleasant truth will be revealed that will not bring anything good, although it can put an end to hostility. Be careful - someone may try to harm you.";
"fiveOfWands_financial" = "Show character and try to defend your own opinion and your point of view. Constant conflicts and discontent, competition are possible. If you want to be rewarded for your work and demonstrate your professionalism, do not relax and show character - this is what will help you cope with all the difficulties.";
"fiveOfCups_financial" = "If you have a misfortune or trouble, it is worth being in yourself for a while to think it over. Do not take any action, as the action is unlikely to be effective and beneficial. It is better to move away from any issues for a while and give yourself time to think and rethink the situation.";
"sixOfPentacles_financial" = "Do not be afraid of failure if you decide to continue your family business or do something completely new. This card portends you good luck and joy, may precede prosperity and material victories, so you should listen to other people's advice or take the advice of your parents.";
"sixOfSwords_financial" = "Think about the solution of those issues that require you to be independent, your own opinion and decisiveness. The card indicates that you should not tell anyone about your plans for the future, so as not to spoil everything.";
"sixOfWands_financial" = "Show character and try to defend your own opinion and your point of view, even if everyone around you thinks differently. Such a card portends a favorable development of events for you, joy and pleasant impressions in life, if you manage to use the chance that will fall to you very soon. Feel free to take on everything new or something that you have long decided to do.";
"sixOfCups_financial" = "Do not take on a lot of things at once and do not plan anything serious - it is better to turn to your past and let yourself dabble, indulge in memories. Such a card portends you happy events, unexpected meetings, so you should not follow strict rules and give up holidays and entertainment.";
"sevenOfPentacles_financial" = "Remember that there is always a time for everything: a time to plant seeds in the soil, a time to cultivate sprouts and a time to harvest, and nothing can change this, since this is a natural course of events, woven into the canvas of divine design. You just need to know how to wait for the harvest, so as not to remain dissatisfied with unripe fruits.";
"sevenOfSwords_financial" = "The Seven of Swords advises not to act impudently, but to try to solve everything diplomatically. What does it mean? Cunning, resourcefulness and clever manipulation, lies, the ability to pass off lies as truth. You will need to use cunning loopholes, not go into open confrontation, and then the issue will be resolved positively.";
"sevenOfWands_financial" = "Your decisive and active actions, the ability to rely on yourself, perseverance and courage in overcoming obstacles - this is what will serve as a guiding star for you to success. You should never give up, because rivals retreat before your perseverance and willpower.";
"sevenOfCups_financial" = "Be attentive to your desires, measure them with the possibilities in order to avoid disappointment and pain. Dreaming will never be harmful, as long as you continue to live in the real world. Escape to the illusory world is a temporary consolation that does not solve problems, but only delays the solution. On the contrary, the card advises a creative person to listen to his images, ideas, thoughts and dreams, perhaps in them he will discover something interesting for the world and become famous.";
"eightOfPentacles_financial" = "The Eight of Pentacles reminds you that you build your own destiny, you are the blacksmith of your own happiness, so you need to work hard, roll up your sleeves, and work for your own good. Do not be afraid of work, the main thing for you is to get involved in it, and then it will bring you satisfaction and, as a bonus, a good financial condition.";
"eightOfSwords_financial" = "The card advises you to treat everything with humility, maybe even sacrifice something, but at the same time reach the goal. Sometimes you can lose a battle in order to finally win the war. The main thing for you is not to be afraid. At the moment, your internal barriers do not allow you to develop, but their presence shows your vector of work on yourself. If you can change yourself, you can change your life.";
"eightOfWands_financial" = "You need to look at the world with wide eyes, go through life looking ahead, be in time everywhere and grab the bird of luck by the tail. Success smiles active and active. Therefore, prepare for takeoff, stock up on patience and diligence, open your eyes and heart to this world wide and rush forward towards new opportunities!";
"eightOfCups_financial" = "The Eight of Cups gives you a recommendation to rest, it's time for a change. Rest will help you gather strength and boldly step into the world of new sensations and emotions. The usual way of life is no longer conducive to development, if it is not interrupted, life can turn into a swamp. It is not worth hitting a blind flight from the hardships of life. What is important here is your awareness of the need for change and the voluntary rejection of the former, alluring illusions. You need to set a new goal for yourself and decisively step towards it. The first step is the most difficult, after it everything will happen faster and more painlessly, because this is a step towards new opportunities.";
"nineOfPentacles_financial" = "The Nine of Pentacles encourages you to streamline everything in your life, breathe deeply and enjoy what you have. You cannot ignore your health, appearance and clothes: all this must correspond to the status of a successful person. You need to calmly observe the course of life, resolve issues measuredly as they come.";
"nineOfSwords_financial" = "The Nine of Swords recommends that you stop giving in to your inner problems - fears, longing, self-doubt and guilt. All this prevents you from acting decisively and makes you give in to emerging obstacles. Nothing is impossible for someone who can overcome their personal demons, because they are the most powerful enemy. Common sense can be a good helper for you.";
"nineOfWands_financial" = "Courage takes cities - this is the general message of the map. You need to be persistent and stubborn, decisive and progressive, then luck will appear on the horizon for you, and the surrounding circumstances will show you the way to it. You need to boldly break all the threads with your past. It has already played its part, and you will not need more. The time is now to move forward without looking back.";
"nineOfCups_financial" = "The Nine of Cups advises you to enjoy the bonuses received from life, to allow yourself to rest without worrying about anything. At the moment, everything around you is running like a well-oiled clockwork, and improving it will only spoil it. If you haven't learned to enjoy success, you don't deserve that success. It is impossible to catch the ghostly bird of happiness, you need to be able to enjoy what you have, because this is happiness itself.";
"tenOfPentacles_financial" = "The Ten of Pentacles advises you to learn to live a full life with all its charms, but not to overdo it with gambling and extravagance. You have the opportunity to feel happy, so you should definitely use it. The main thing for you to remember is that in any situation there are close people who accept you the way you are, love and wish you happiness. Another point you should not forget is to share wealth with loved ones: finances, experience, wisdom. They will repay the same, multiplying what is already there.";
"tenOfSwords_financial" = "The Ten of Swords recommends that you decisively part with past problems, your fears and internal prejudices that deprive you of strength, exhaust your soul and hinder your movement forward. Circumstances make you feel like a victim, but you need to try to avoid these feelings.";
"tenOfWands_financial" = "Having taken on a heavy load, you should not stop, lament and whine. You need to persistently move forward, because sooner or later your goal will be achieved. If you carry your burden, you can get liberation, feel lightness, get freedom and become a winner.";
"tenOfCups_financial" = "The Ten of Cups recommends that you take advantage of the best time to review your relationships within your family, as well as with friends and colleagues at work and study. Now is the best time to bring your relationship to the ideal. The card also indicates that you can easily fall into the trap of your ideals, so it's best not to idealize anything at all. Another danger that this card warns about is dissolution in a family or team with the loss of one's individuality. You need not only to hear others, but also to be able to gently convey your point of view to them. Only with a common compromise can one come to complete mutual understanding and happiness.";
